# Altium CRM Frontend

Canonical instructions live in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Do not invent parallel policies.

## Before coding

1. Read `AGENTS.md`.
2. Open only the docs needed for the task.
3. Inspect existing features/components/patterns.

## Hard constraints

- No `git commit` / `git push` / tags / remote changes unless the user explicitly asks.
- No CRM business screens, auth, or Netlify connection unless requested.
- No HTTP calls from presentational components — use `src/services/http/`.
- Pinia for app/UI state; TanStack Query for remote data — no duplication.
- TypeScript strict; no `any` / `@ts-ignore` without justification.
- Source files ≤ 1000 lines (prefer ≤ 500).
- Update feature/component Markdown + CHANGELOG in the same task.
- Run `pnpm check` before reporting completion of non-trivial changes.

